      <activity id="84d67165-e611-5e5f-84c3-c5f306a67821" activityNameId="ea8ad7fa-279e-5da4-8a5f-0baba8f9a729" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, burned in boiler atmospheric burner non-modulating &lt;100kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, burned in boiler atmospheric burner non-modulating &lt;100kW
NOx and CO emissions derived from measurements under controlled conditions;
UUID: 3c1a6e57-2f5d-32f5-b7b9-704abe2820e3
The module includes fuel input from low pressure (CH) network, infrastructure (boiler), emissions to air, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Natural gas input (low pressure) and emission data extrapolated from Switzerland to Europe (RER).
Technology: Models on market
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, manufacturers; CO and NOx emissions from (SVGW 2002), sample size (number of selected devices for which emission values are given in SVGW list): CO 269 , NOx 289 . 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3c1a6e57-2f5d-32f5-b7b9-704abe2820e3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
